00000;background-color:rgb(217, 217, 217);font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">权限申请时机</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:58.25px"><td colSpan="1" rowspan="4" style="overflow:hidden;border-left:1px solid #171a1d;border-right:1px solid #171a1d;border-bottom:1px solid #171a1d;border-top:1px solid #171a1d;padding:4px 8px;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:7px;padding-right:7px"><p style="text-align:center;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">Android</span></p></td><td colSpan="1" rowspan="1" style="overflow:hidden;border-left:1px solid #171a1d;border-right:1px solid #171a1d;border-bottom:1px solid #171a1d;border-top:1px solid #171a1d;padding:4px 8px;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:7px;padding-right:7px"><p style="text-align:center;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">精确定位</span></p><p style="text-align:center;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">ACCESS_FINE_LOCATION</span></p></td><td colSpan="1" rowspan="2" style="overflow:hidden;border-left:1px solid #171a1d;border-right:1px solid #171a1d;border-bottom:1px solid #171a1d;border-top:1px solid #171a1d;padding:4px 8px;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:7px;padding-right:7px"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">视用户授权的权限（精准定位、粗略定位）用于给应用返回最终用户精确或粗略的位置信息，并供开发者基于用户的位置信息提供相应服务</span></p></td><td colSpan="1" rowspan="2" style="overflow:hidden;border-left:1px solid #171a1d;border-right:1px solid #171a1d;border-bottom:1px solid #171a1d;border-top:1px solid #171a1d;padding:4px 8px;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:7px;padding-right:7px"><p style="text-align:center;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">是</span></p></td><td colSpan="1" rowspan="14" style="overflow:hidden;border-left:1px solid #171a1d;border-right:1px solid #171a1d;border-bottom:1px solid #171a1d;border-top:1px solid #171a1d;padding:4px 8px;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-wrap:break-word;vertical-align:top;padding-left:7px;padding-right:7px"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">由开发者应用决定，当您同意向开发者应用授予该权限时开启</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:58.25px"><td colSpan="1" rowspan="1" style="overflow:hidden;border-left:1px solid #171a1d;border-right:1px solid #171a1d;border-bottom:1px solid #171a1d;border-top:1px solid #171a1d;padding:4px 8px;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:7px;padding-right:7px"><p style="text-align:center;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">粗略定位ACCESS_COARSE_LOCATION</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:83.5px"><td colSpan="1" rowspan="1" style="overflow:hidden;border-left:1px solid #171a1d;border-right:1px solid #171a1d;border-bottom:1px solid #171a1d;border-top:1px solid #171a1d;padding:4px 8px;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:7px;padding-right:7px"><p style="text-align:center;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">始终允许访问位置信息</span></p><p style="text-align:center;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">ACCESS_BACKGROUND_LOCATION</span></p></td><td colSpan="1" rowspan="1" style="overflow:hidden;border-left:1px solid #171a1d;border-right:1px solid #171a1d;border-bottom:1px solid #171a1d;border-top:1px solid #171a1d;padding:4px 8px;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:7px;padding-right:7px"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">用于在后台场景下给应用返回用户的位置信息，并供开发者基于用户的位置信息提供相应服务</span></p></td><td colSpan="1" rowspan="1" style="overflow:hidden;border-left:1px solid #171a1d;border-right:1px solid #171a1d;border-bottom:1px solid #171a1d;border-top:1px solid #171a1d;padding:4px 8px;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:7px;padding-right:7px"><p style="text-align:center;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">否</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:83.5px"><td colSpan="1" rowspan="1" style="overflow:hidden;border-left:1px solid #171a1d;border-right:1px solid #171a1d;border-bottom:1px solid #171a1d;border-top:1px solid #171a1d;padding:4px 8px;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:7px;padding-right:7px"><p style="text-align:center;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">网络与WIFI状态</span></p><p style="text-align:center;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE；ACCESS_WIFI_STATE； CHANGE_WIFI_STATE；INTERNET</span></p></td><td colSpan="1" rowspan="1" style="overflow:hidden;border-left:1px solid #171a1d;border-right:1px solid #171a1d;border-bottom:1px solid #171a1d;border-top:1px solid #171a1d;padding:4px 8px;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:7px;padding-right:7px"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">用于访问定位服务，以帮助开发者向您提供定位功能，同时WiFi信息的访问会用于网络定位</span></p></td><td colSpan="1" rowspan="1" style="overflow:hidden;border-left:1px solid #171a1d;border-right:1px solid #171a1d;border-bottom:1px solid #171a1d;border-top:1px solid #171a1d;padding:4px 8px;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:7px;padding-right:7px"><p style="text-align:center;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">是</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:78.1953px"><td colSpan="1" rowspan="6" style="overflow:hidden;border-left:1px solid #171a1d;border-right:1px solid #171a1d;border-bottom:1px solid #171a1d;border-top:1px solid #171a1d;padding:4px 8px;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:7px;padding-right:7px"><p style="text-align:center;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">iOS</span></p></td><td colSpan="1" rowspan="1" style="overflow:hidden;border-left:1px solid #171a1d;border-right:1px solid #171a1d;border-bottom:1px solid #171a1d;border-top:1px solid #171a1d;padding:4px 8px;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:7px;padding-right:7px"><p style="text-align:center;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">当APP正在使用时访问位置</span></p><p style="text-align:center;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription</span></p></td><td colSpan="1" rowspan="4" style="overflow:hidden;border-left:1px solid #171a1d;border-right:1px solid #171a1d;border-bottom:1px solid #171a1d;border-top:1px solid #171a1d;padding:4px 8px;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:7px;padding-right:7px"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">视用户授权的权限（精准定位、粗略定位）用于给应用返回最终用户精确或粗略的位置信息，并供开发者基于用户的位置信息提供相应服务</span></p></td><td colSpan="1" rowspan="4" style="overflow:hidden;border-left:1px solid #171a1d;border-right:1px solid #171a1d;border-bottom:1px solid #171a1d;border-top:1px solid #171a1d;padding:4px 8px;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:7px;padding-right:7px"><p style="text-align:center;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">是</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:78.1953px"><td colSpan="1" rowspan="1" style="overflow:hidden;border-left:1px solid #171a1d;border-right:1px solid #171a1d;border-bottom:1px solid #171a1d;border-top:1px solid #171a1d;padding:4px 8px;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:7px;padding-right:7px"><p style="text-align:center;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">同时请求“始终”和“使用时”定位权限</span></p><p style="text-align:center;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:78.1953px"><td colSpan="1" rowspan="1" style="overflow:hidden;border-left:1px solid #171a1d;border-right:1px solid #171a1d;border-bottom:1px solid #171a1d;border-top:1px solid #171a1d;padding:4px 8px;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:7px;padding-right:7px"><p style="text-align:center;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">连续定位（iOS 11之前版本）</span></p><p style="text-align:center;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">NSLocationAlwaysAndWhenInUseUsageDescription</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:78.1953px"><td colSpan="1" rowspan="1" style="overflow:hidden;border-left:1px solid #171a1d;border-right:1px solid #171a1d;border-bottom:1px solid #171a1d;border-top:1px solid #171a1d;padding:4px 8px;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:7px;padding-right:7px"><p style="text-align:center;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">临时精确定位（iOS 14+）</span></p><p style="text-align:center;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">NSLocationTemporaryUsageDescriptionDictionary</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:83.5px"><td colSpan="1" rowspan="1" style="overflow:hidden;border-left:1px solid #171a1d;border-right:1px solid #171a1d;border-bottom:1px solid #171a1d;border-top:1px solid #171a1d;padding:4px 8px;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:7px;padding-right:7px"><p style="text-align:center;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">始终允许访问位置信息</span></p><p style="text-align:center;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">Background Modes：</span></p><p style="text-align:center;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">Location updates&quot;</span></p></td><td colSpan="1" rowspan="1" style="overflow:hidden;border-left:1px solid #171a1d;border-right:1px solid #171a1d;border-bottom:1px solid #171a1d;border-top:1px solid #171a1d;padding:4px 8px;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:7px;padding-right:7px"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">用于在后台场景下给应用返回用户的位置信息，并供开发者基于用户的位置信息提供相应服务</span></p></td><td colSpan="1" rowspan="1" style="overflow:hidden;border-left:1px solid #171a1d;border-right:1px solid #171a1d;border-bottom:1px solid #171a1d;border-top:1px solid #171a1d;padding:4px 8px;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:7px;padding-right:7px"><p style="text-align:center;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">否</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:67px"><td colSpan="1" rowspan="1" style="overflow:hidden;border-left:1px solid #171a1d;border-right:1px solid #171a1d;border-bottom:1px solid #171a1d;border-top:1px solid #171a1d;padding:4px 8px;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:7px;padding-right:7px"><p style="text-align:center;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">获取广告标识</span></p><p style="text-align:center;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">NSUserTrackingUsageDescription&quot;</span></p></td><td colSpan="1" rowspan="1" style="overflow:hidden;border-left:1px solid #171a1d;border-right:1px solid #171a1d;border-bottom:1px solid #171a1d;border-top:1px solid #171a1d;padding:4px 8px;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:7px;padding-right:7px"><p