t:7px;padding-right:7px"><p style="text-align:center;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">Android</span></p></td><td colSpan="1" rowspan="1" style="overflow:hidden;border-left:1px solid #171a1d;border-right:1px solid #171a1d;border-bottom:1px solid #171a1d;border-top:1px solid #171a1d;padding:4px 8px;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:7px;padding-right:7px"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">网络与WIFI状态</span></p><p style="text-align:center;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE；</span></p><p style="text-align:center;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">ACCESS_WIFI_STATE；CALL_PHONE；</span></p><p style="text-align:center;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">.CHANGE_WIFI_STATE；</span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">.INTERNET</span></p></td><td colSpan="1" rowspan="1" style="overflow:hidden;border-left:1px solid #171a1d;border-right:1px solid #171a1d;border-bottom:1px solid #171a1d;border-top:1px solid #171a1d;padding:4px 8px;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:7px;padding-right:7px"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">用于访问导航服务，以帮助开发者向您提供导航功能，同时WiFi信息的访问会用于网络定位</span></p></td><td colSpan="1" rowspan="1" style="overflow:hidden;border-left:1px solid #171a1d;border-right:1px solid #171a1d;border-bottom:1px solid #171a1d;border-top:1px solid #171a1d;padding:4px 8px;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:7px;padding-right:7px"><p style="text-align:center;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">是</span></p></td><td colSpan="1" rowspan="6" style="overflow:hidden;border-left:1px solid #171a1d;border-right:1px solid #171a1d;border-bottom:1px solid #171a1d;border-top:1px solid #171a1d;padding:4px 8px;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-wrap:break-word;vertical-align:top;padding-left:7px;padding-right:7px"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">由开发者应用决定，当您同意向开发者应用授予该权限时开启</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:39.1328px"><td colSpan="1" rowspan="1" style="overflow:hidden;border-left:1px solid #171a1d;border-right:1px solid #171a1d;border-bottom:1px solid #171a1d;border-top:1px solid #171a1d;padding:4px 8px;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:7px;padding-right:7px"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">BLUETOOTH</span></p></td><td colSpan="1" rowspan="1" style="overflow:hidden;border-left:1px solid #171a1d;border-right:1px solid #171a1d;border-bottom:1px solid #171a1d;border-top:1px solid #171a1d;padding:4px 8px;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:7px;padding-right:7px"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">建立链接后开发者可选用蓝牙通道进行TTS播报</span></p></td><td colSpan="1" rowspan="1" style="overflow:hidden;border-left:1px solid #171a1d;border-right:1px solid #171a1d;border-bottom:1px solid #171a1d;border-top:1px solid #171a1d;padding:4px 8px;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:7px;padding-right:7px"><p style="text-align:center;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">否</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:50.5px"><td colSpan="1" rowspan="2" style="overflow:hidden;border-left:1px solid #171a1d;border-right:1px solid #171a1d;border-bottom:1px solid #171a1d;border-top:1px solid #171a1d;padding:4px 8px;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:7px;padding-right:7px"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">前台服务申请电池优化白名单</span><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined"> </span><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">WAKE_LOCK</span></p></td><td colSpan="1" rowspan="1" style="overflow:hidden;border-left:1px solid #171a1d;border-right:1px solid #171a1d;border-bottom:1px solid #171a1d;border-top:1px solid #171a1d;padding:4px 8px;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:7px;padding-right:7px"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">用于持续获取并上传您的位置信息，来为您提供导航服务</span></p></td><td colSpan="1" rowspan="1" style="overflow:hidden;border-left:1px solid #171a1d;border-right:1px solid #171a1d;border-bottom:1px solid #171a1d;border-top:1px solid #171a1d;padding:4px 8px;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:7px;padding-right:7px"><p style="text-align:center;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">否</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:83.5px"><td colSpan="1" rowspan="1" style="overflow:hidden;border-left:1px solid #171a1d;border-right:1px solid #171a1d;border-bottom:1px solid #171a1d;border-top:1px solid #171a1d;padding:4px 8px;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:7px;padding-right:7px"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">用于在持续获取并上传您的位置信息过程中，不受电池剩余电量的影响，始终以标准模式工作来为您提供导航服务</span></p></td><td colSpan="1" rowspan="1" style="overflow:hidden;border-left:1px solid #171a1d;border-right:1px solid #171a1d;border-bottom:1px solid #171a1d;border-top:1px solid #171a1d;padding:4px 8px;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:7px;padding-right:7px"><p style="text-align:center;t