 New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">用于持续获取并上传您的位置信息，来为您提供导航服务</span></p></td><td colSpan="1" rowspan="1" style="overflow:hidden;border-left:1px solid #171a1d;border-right:1px solid #171a1d;border-bottom:1px solid #171a1d;border-top:1px solid #171a1d;padding:4px 8px;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:7px;padding-right:7px"><p style="text-align:center;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">否</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:83.5px"><td colSpan="1" rowspan="2" style="overflow:hidden;border-left:1px solid #171a1d;border-right:1px solid #171a1d;border-bottom:1px solid #171a1d;border-top:1px solid #171a1d;padding:4px 8px;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:7px;padding-right:7px"><p style="text-align:center;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">iOS</span></p></td><td colSpan="1" rowspan="1" style="overflow:hidden;border-left:1px solid #171a1d;border-right:1px solid #171a1d;border-bottom:1px solid #171a1d;border-top:1px solid #171a1d;padding:4px 8px;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:7px;padding-right:7px"><p style="text-align:center;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">广告标识（iOS 14.5）：</span></p><p style="text-align:center;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">NSUserTrackingUsageDescription</span></p></td><td colSpa