mily:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">每次启动时获取1次</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:24px;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:8px;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined"> </span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:32px;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:8px;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">（2）设备权限</span></p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;table-layout:fixed;width:945px"><colgroup><col width="112"/><col width="274"/><col width="256"/><col width="79"/><col width="224"/></colgroup><tbody><tr style="height:34px"><td colSpan="1" rowspan="1" style="overflow:hidden;border-left:1px solid #171a1d;border-right:1px solid #171a1d;border-bottom:1px solid #171a1d;border-top:1px solid #171a1d;padding:4px 8px;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(217, 217, 217);padding-left:7px;padding-right:7px"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="font-weight:bold;color:#000000;background-color:rgb(217, 217, 217);font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">系统版本</span></p></td><td colSpan="1" rowspan="1" style="overflow:hidden;border-left:1px solid #171a1d;border-right:1px solid #171a1d;border-bottom:1px solid #171a1d;border-top:1px solid #171a1d;padding:4px 8px;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(217, 217, 217);padding-left:7px;padding-right:7px"><p style="text-align:center;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="font-weight:bold;color:#000000;background-color:rgb(217, 217, 217);font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">权限名称</span></p></td><td colSpan="1" rowspan="1" style="overflow:hidden;border-left:1px solid #171a1d;border-right:1px solid #171a1d;border-bottom:1px solid #171a1d;border-top:1px solid #171a1d;padding:4px 8px;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(217, 217, 217);padding-left:7px;padding-right:7px"><p style="text-align:center;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="font-weight:bold;color:#000000;background-color:rgb(217, 217, 217);font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">功能描述</span></p></td><td colSpan="1" rowspan="1" style="overflow:hidden;border-left:1px solid #171a1d;border-right:1px solid #171a1d;border-bottom:1px solid #171a1d;border-top:1px solid #171a1d;padding:4px 8px;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(217, 217, 217);padding-left:7px;padding-right:7px"><p style="text-align:center;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="font-weight:bold;color:#000000;background-color:rgb(217, 217, 217);font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">是否</span></p><p style="text-align:center;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="font-weight:bold;color:#000000;background-color:rgb(217, 217, 217);font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">必须</span></p></td><td colSpan="1" rowspan="1" style="overflow:hidden;border-left:1px solid #171a1d;border-right:1px solid #171a1d;border-bottom:1px solid #171a1d;border-top:1px solid #171a1d;padding:4px 8px;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(217, 217, 217);padding-left:7px;padding-right:7px"><p style="text-align:center;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="font-weight:bold;color:#000000;background-color:rgb(217, 217, 217);font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">权限申请时机</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:110.5px"><td colSpan="1" rowspan="4" style="overflow:hidden;border-left:1px solid #171a1d;border-right:1px solid #171a1d;border-bottom:1px solid #171a1d;border-top:1px solid #171a1d;padding:4px 8px;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:7px;padding-right:7px"><p style="text-align:center;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">Android</span></p></td><td colSpan="1" rowspan="1" style="overflow:hidden;border-left:1px solid #171a1d;border-right:1px solid #171a1d;border-bottom:1px solid #171a1d;border-top:1px solid #171a1d;padding:4px 8px;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:7px;padding-right:7px"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:0;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:100%"><span data-type="text" style="color:#000000;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times New Roman, undefined">网络与WIFI状态
